      "target": "../sections/s018-json-web-tokens.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "#### JSON Web Tokens\n[JSON Web Tokens (JWT)](https://jwt.io/) are used to store state (and authentication) information between requests. This is the format of token the REST API returns to the client. The client should return the JWT to the server in subsequent requests.",
