      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "Login",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s029-login.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "## Login\n**POST /api/authn/login**\n\nThis endpoint only accepts the `POST` method. Parameters and body structure depend on the authentication method to use.\n\nA `WWW-Authenticate` header is returned listing the different authentication method supported by the system.\nBelow an example listing the password and shibboleth authentication:  \n`WWW-Authenticate: shibboleth realm=\"DSpace REST API\", location=\"https://demo.dspace.org/Shibboleth.sso/Login?target=https%3A%2F%2Fdemo.dspace.org\", password realm=\"DSpace REST API\"`\n\nReturn codes\n- 200 Ok. If the authentication succeed. The JWT will be returned",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "not-summarised"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "library/dspace-7-rest-contract/blocks/prose-s030-username-password-based-authentication",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "Username Password based authentication",
      "pageStart": null,
      "pageEnd": null,
      "target": "../sections/s030-username-password-based-authentication.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "### Username Password based authentication\nParameters must be sent in the body of a `x-www-form-urlencoded` request, i.e\n\n```\ncurl -v -X POST https://{dspace-server.url}/server/api/authn/login --data \"user=dspacedemo%2Badmin%40gmail.com&password=dspace\" -H \"X-XSRF-TOKEN: {csrf-token}\" -b \"DSPACE-XSRF-COOKIE={xsrf-cookie}\"\n```\n\nPlease note that authentication requires passing a valid [CSRF token](csrf-tokens.md) header and cookie, previously obtained from the REST API. Also note that `curl` assumes `-H 'Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded'` for a POST request as default.\n\nThis call",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "not-summarised"
      }
    },
    {
