      "target": "../sections/s031-shibboleth-authentication.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "### Shibboleth authentication\nThe shibboleth realm exposes a location attribute that must be followed by the client to establish a shibboleth session so that subsequent call to the login endpoint will succeed returning the JWT.",
