      "target": "../sections/s040-main-endpoint.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "## Main Endpoint\n**/api/authz/authorizations**\n\nAs we don't have yet an use case to iterate over all the existent authorizations the main endpoint is not implemented and a 405 error code is returned according to our [general error response codes](README.md#Error-codes).",
